comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T18:54:48.188Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-04: searched all statuses for reindex network timeout and background semantic mutation refresh. Closed pm-gvk2 owns the shared HTTP fixture and pm-7rlp owns historical suite performance, but neither records this newly reproduced mock-lifetime escape; created this child issue with lineage to both."
  "2026-08-04T19:54:39.425Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence 2026-08-04: mutation refresh is cache-only before this test creates fixtures, so no detached semantic HTTP request escapes the reindex mock. The linked residual test passed in 705ms (2.87s including runner startup), below its 30-second acceptance ceiling; the direct full suite passed 433 files and 6,850 tests at exact 100/100/100/100."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T19:54:39.879Z","harness:codex","When a test configures remote semantic endpoints but creates fixtures before installing its HTTP mock, set mutation_refresh_policy=cache_only before those mutations; this preserves explicit reindex transport coverage while keeping incidental mutation refresh deterministic and offline."
